  "abstract": "This submission corrects a JAX UnexpectedTracerError in the previous attempt (ID 378). The error was caused by a forbidden side effect (loading a file from within a JIT-compiled loss function). This version fixes the issue by loading the pre-computed variance vector once at the script level, making it a global constant that can be safely read by the pure loss function. The hypothesis remains unchanged.",
